---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Website Terms | Dr Kiran’s MyDentist"
  description="Information about the use of MyDentist treatment guides, clinic details and enquiry links."
>
  <section class="page-hero wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">WEBSITE INFORMATION</span>
    <h1>Terms of use.</h1>
    <p>A few things to know when using this website.</p>
  </section>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <h2>General information</h2>
    <p>
      The treatment information on this website is intended to help you understand dental care
      options. It is not a diagnosis or a personalised treatment recommendation. Your treating
      dentist will assess your needs and explain suitable options.
    </p>
    <h2>Enquiries and appointments</h2>
    <p>
      Using a phone, email or WhatsApp link does not book or confirm an appointment. Please confirm
      availability, branch arrangements, fees and any preparation directly with the clinic.
    </p>
    <h2>Clinic information</h2>
    <p>
      Opening hours and contact details are provided to help you plan a visit. Please check with the
      branch before travelling, particularly on holidays. Treatment and equipment availability
      should be confirmed with the branch.
    </p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      This website links to services such as WhatsApp and Google Maps, and to general educational
      resources. Those services are operated by their respective providers.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions or corrections</h2>
    <p>
      If you notice an error or have a question about the website, contact{' '}
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:kiransdentalhospital@gmail.com">
        kiransdentalhospital@gmail.com
      </a>
      .
    </p>
    <h2>Visual asset attribution</h2>
    <p>
      External surface study adapted for visualisation from{' '}
      <a href="https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/xjsx7nfhj8/1">Díaz et al.</a>, licensed under{' '}
      <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
